2. It aims to support the creation, awareness and conservation of photographic images. The purpose consists of exploring the challenges and contradictions surrounding document images in order to examine this very visual world that we inhabit. Three temporary exhibitions are organised each year. The collection is central to the A Foundation. It comprises great sets of works by photographers with a documentary tendency; many of them are highly regarded throughout the world. Since 2015, the A Foundation has also devoted one exhibition per season to a young creator. It is a real platform for photographic images, is also a partner for exhibition and publishing projects organised in conjunction with other cultural institutions. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"FONDATION A STICHTING","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Fundaci\u00f3n A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"En octubre de 2012, la Fundaci\u00f3n A stichting abri\u00f3 sus puertas en el sur de Bruselas en el lugar de la antigua f\u00e1brica Bata. Creada bajo la iniciativa de Astrid Ullens de Schooten, y reconocida por promover el inter\u00e9s p\u00fablico, tiene una vocaci\u00f3n para apoyar la creaci\u00f3n, el conocimiento y la preservaci\u00f3n de la imagen fotogr\u00e1fica. Ya no existe nada que no parezca haber sido atestiguado por la imagen. Sin embargo, la idea de dejar constancia sobre el uso real de la fotograf\u00eda no es necesaria. Lo que ocurre con nuestra capacidad de ver y percibir cuando en su abundancia y su inmediaci\u00f3n virtual, las im\u00e1genes que nos rodean se est\u00e1n convirtiendo r\u00e1pida y poderosamente m\u00e1s complicadas. El proyecto de la fundaci\u00f3n consiste en explorar las riesgos y contradicciones  de la imagen-documento, cuestionando un mundo en el que todo es visible. Organiza tres exhibiciones temporales cada a\u00f1o.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":13764,"location":{"lat":50.82266385,"lon":4.32563819},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-30T01:35:15+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:38:02+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/082c03a869b11acc6ee0d24a218b41d930926444.jpg","width":591,"height":835,"ratio":0.71,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Regards de Femmes","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Regards de Femmes","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Regards de Femmes","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-09-24","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-09-25","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-09-28","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-09-29","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-09-30","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-01","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-02","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-05","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-06","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-07","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-08","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-09","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-12","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-13","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:00"},{"day":"2022-10-14","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"18:00:0