rentes.\r\nEn bref : un enseignement et des formations de qualit\u00e9,\u202fdispens\u00e9s dans un cadre multiculturel favorisant l\u2019\u00e9change, le respect et la convivialit\u00e9 !\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Alliance Fran\u00e7aise Bruxelles-Europe \u2013 Centre Europ\u00e9en de Langue Fran\u00e7aise","address_street_name":"Kunstlaan","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@alliancefr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.alliancefr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 788 21 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Kunstlaan, 46","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"In overeenstemming met haar opdracht \u2013het promoten van de Franse taal en cultuur \u2013 programmeert de Alliance Fran\u00e7aise voordrachten, workshops, taallessen en verschillende culturele activiteiten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Alliance Fran\u00e7aise Bruxelles-Europe \u2013 Centre Europ\u00e9en de Langue Fran\u00e7aise","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@alliancefr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.alliancefr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 788 21 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 46","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"In accordance with her assignment - promoting French language and culture - the Alliance Fran\u00e7aise is programming lectures, workshops, language classes and various cultural activities.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Alliance Fran\u00e7aise Bruxelles-Europe \u2013 Centre Europ\u00e9en de Langue Fran\u00e7aise","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@alliancefr.be","website":"ht