zles is the best way to visit the center of Brussels while investigating a case through the ages. Put on your detective hat and help us find the traitor among us!","longdescr":"We invite you to go on a city hunt through the streets of Brussels! You will start your adventure at Enygma and then embark on a great temporal investigation! Equipped with a backpack and a mission diary, we will send you to scour the streets of our beautiful capital and discover it from a highly original angle. Bring your friends, family or colleagues and join the challenge!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.enygma.be","email":"info@enygma.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 96 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 96 37","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542796"},"nl":{"name":"Brussels By Puzzles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542796"},"en":{"name":"Brussels By Puzzles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542796"},"de":{"name":"Brussels By Puzzles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542796"},"it":{"name":"Brussels By Puzzles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542796"},"sp":{"name":"Brussels By Puzzles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"ph