port_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.33974515584373},{"id":537752,"date_start":"2022-09-16","date_end":"2022-11-05","date_next":"2022-09-30","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,39],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Photographie"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Fotografie"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Photography"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Youth through the lens","shortdescr":"An exhibition through the lens of young fashion photographers.","longdescr":"La g\u00e9n\u00e9ration Z est en passe de devenir la g\u00e9n\u00e9ration la plus importante et la plus diversifi\u00e9e qui soit. Elle repr\u00e9sente 2,5 milliards de personnes, n\u00e9es entre 1996 et 2010, qui scrollent sur Instagram depuis leur plus jeune \u00e2ge. C'est la premi\u00e8re g\u00e9n\u00e9ration qui ne peut imaginer la vie sans Internet et qui a grandi dans un monde enti\u00e8rement num\u00e9rique. Pourtant, dans leurs photographies, iels reviennent aux techniques analogues du pass\u00e9.\r\n\r\nLes jeunes qui font partie de la g\u00e9n\u00e9ration Z accordent une grande importance \u00e0 l'expression individuelle. Iels cherchent \u00e0 se distinguer de la norme. Avec les r\u00e9seaux sociaux comme outil cr\u00e9atif et social, cette g\u00e9n\u00e9ration repr\u00e9sente une culture virale et visuelle de l'expression personnelle. Mais c'est aussi une g\u00e9n\u00e9ration qui grandit dans une p\u00e9riode de grande agitation sociale due \u00e0 la crise \u00e9conomique, au changement climatique et aux conflits politiques. En raison de cette agitation sociale, les jeunes accordent une grande importance aux notions de durabilit\u00e9, diversit\u00e9 et tol\u00e9rance.\r\n\r\nMAD Brussels pr\u00e9sente Youth through the Lens, une exposition qui t\u00e9moigne du point de vue de cette g\u00e9n\u00e9ration sur le monde actuel de la mode. Sept photographes expriment \u00e0 leur mani\u00e8re leurs point de vue sur la sc\u00e9ne mode.\r\n\r\nAvec les photographes, Antwan.jpg, Jordan Kbs, Max Klinkum, Light Striking, Paul-Louis Godier, Everythingisjpg, Shania Semeli \r\n\r\nEn pr\u00e9sentant les jeunes marques de mode bruxelloises m\u00e9son, S.T.O.R.M.S, Rio Leone, Igor Jasinski, BLACKMOON, Seikatsu, Simon Maxim\u00e9, Brique, The Zed\r\n\r\nCoordonn\u00e9 par MAD Bruxelles et Urielle Musawu Bundo","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537752"},"nl":{"name":"Youth through the lens","shortdescr":"Een tentoonstelling door de lens van jonge modefotografen.","longdescr":"De Generatie Z is een generatie die uitgroeit tot de grootste en meest diverse generatie die er is. Het is een generatie die 2,5 miljard mensen vertegenwoordigt die geboren zijn tussen 1996 en 2010 en al van jongs af aan scrollen op Instagram. Opgegroeid in een digitale wereld kunnen ze zich een leven zonder internet niet meer inbeelden. Toch grijpen ze in hun fotografie terug naar analoge technieken uit het verleden.  \r\n\r\nJongeren die deel uitmaken van Generatie Z hechten veel waarde aan individuele expressie. Ze willen zich onderscheiden van de massa. Met sociale media als creatieve tool, vertegenwoordigt deze generatie een virale en visuele cultuur van zelfexpressie. Maar het is ook een generatie die opgroeit in tijden van grote sociale onrust als gevolg van de economische crisis, klimaatverandering en politieke conflicten. Door deze sociale onrust hechten jongeren veel waarde aan de thema's duurzaamheid, diversiteit en openheid. \r\n\r\nMAD Brussels presenteert Youth through the Lens, een tentoonstelling die de kijk van deze generatie op de hedendaagse modewereld toont. Zeven fotografen geven elk hun kijk op de huidige modewereld en hoe ze zich op hun eigen unieke manier uitdrukken.\r\n\r\nMet fotografen, Antwan.jpg, Jordan Kbs, Max Klinkum, Light Striking, Paul-Louis Godier, Everythingisjpg, Shania Semeli \r\n\r\nIn samenwerking met de Brussels modemerken m\u00e9son, S.T.O.R.M.S, Rio Leone, Igor Jasinski, BLACKMOON, Seikatsu, Simon Maxim\u00e9, Brique, The Zed\r\n\r\nGeco\u00f6rdineerd door MAD Brussel en Urielle Musawu Bundo","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/youth-through-lens","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537752"},"en":{"name":"Youth through the lens","shortdescr":"An exhibition through the lens of young fashion photographers.","longdescr":"Generation Z is growing into the largest and most diverse generation there is. It is a generation that represents 2.5 billion people born between 1996 and 2010 and has been scrolling on Instagram since a young age. It is the first generation that cannot imagine life without the Internet and grew up in a fully digital world. Yet in their photography, they return to analogue techniques from the past.  \r\n\r\nYoung people who are part of Generation Z highly value individual expression. They want to stand out from the crowd. With social media as a creative and social tool, this generation represents a viral, visual culture of self-expression. But it is also a generation that is growing up in times of great social unrest due to the economic crisis, climate change and political conflicts. Because of this social unrest, young people place a high value on the themes of sustainability, diversity and openness. \r\n\r\nMAD Brussels presents Youth through the Lens, an exhibition that shows this generation's view on the contemporary fashion world. Seven photographers each present their perspective on the current fashion scene and how they express themselves in their own unique way.\r\n\r\nWith the photographers, Antwan.jpg, Jordan Kbs, Max Klinkum, Light Striking, Paul-Louis Godier, Everythingisjpg, Shania Semeli \r\n\r\nPresenting young Brussels fashion brands m\u00e9son, S.T.O.R.M.S, Rio Leone, Igor Jasinski, BLACKMOON, Seikatsu, Simon Maxim\u00e9, Brique, The Zed\r\n\r\nCoordinated by MAD Brussels and Urielle Musawu Bundo","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537752"},"de":{"name":"Youth through the lens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537752"},"it":{"name":"Youth through the lens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537752"},"sp":{"name":"Youth through the lens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537752"},"pt":{"name":"Youth through the lens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537752"},"cn":{"name":"Youth through the lens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537752"}},"place":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"B