sloten","dinsdag, woensdag, donderdag en vrijdag: van 09:00 tot 16:00","zaterdag en zondag: van 11:00 tot 17:00"],"en":["monday: closed","tuesday, wednesday, thursday and friday: from 09:00 to 16:00","saturday and sunday: from 11:00 to 17:00"]},"date_start":"2022-09-17","date_end":"2022-11-06","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cat\u00e9gorie 1"},"nl":{"name":"Categorie 1"},"en":{"name":"Category 1"}},"value":65},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cat\u00e9gorie 2"},"nl":{"name":"Categorie 2"},"en":{"name":"Category 2"}},"value":90},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cat\u00e9gorie 3"},"nl":{"name":"Categorie 3"},"en":{"name":"Category 3"}},"value":70},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cat\u00e9gorie 4"},"nl":{"name":"Categorie 4"},"en":{"name":"Category 4"}},"value":135}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-30T01:36:18+02:00","published_at":"2022-07-27T14:49:28+02:00","backoffice_id":258988,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.33974515584373},{"id":541727,"date_start":"2022-09-08","date_end":"2022-10-29","date_next":"2022-09-30","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[24,34],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Galeries","Pluridisciplinair"],"en":["Art Galleries","Multidisciplinary"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Regards Crois\u00e9s : l'exposition c\u00e9l\u00e9brant un double anniversaire","shortdescr":"A Bruxelles, Laurent Jacob pr\u00e9sente en la Modesti Perdriolle Gallery, sous le titre de Regards Crois\u00e9s, une s\u00e9lection d\u2019artistes belges : les peintres Marc Angeli et Michel Boulanger, de m\u00eame que les plasticiens Roberta Gigante et Patrick Regout. Ponctuant la confrontation de leurs \u0153uvres, un exceptionnel ensemble de b\u00e2tons de marche \u00e9thiopiens.","longdescr":"Il y a un an, la Modesti Perdriolle Gallery s\u2019ouvrait donc sur une exposition dont le titre, Contemporary, One Word, Several Worlds, constituait comme le symbole d\u2019une approche commune de la chose artistique et de la future programmation d\u2019une enseigne qui f\u00eate aujourd\u2019hui sa premi\u00e8re bougie par un double \u00e9v\u00e9nement !\r\n\r\nFruit de la rencontre avec le commissaire d\u2019exposition li\u00e9geois Laurent Jacob, une double exposition, \u00e0 Li\u00e8ge et \u00e0 Bruxelles, pr\u00e9sente, sous le titre de Regards Crois\u00e9s, la transversalit\u00e9 du regard de ces deux exp\u00e9riences de la chose artistique : celle de Laurent Jacob et celle de Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle, tous deux \u00ab amateurs des figures libres en g\u00e9n\u00e9ral, et de celle du grand \u00e9cart en particulier. \u00bb\r\n___\r\nLe 9 septembre 2021, le collectionneur, critique d'art et commissaire d'exposition fran\u00e7ais Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle, install\u00e9 \u00e0 Bruxelles depuis 2019, inaugurait un espace permanent d\u2019exposition avec l\u2019entrepreneur Maximiliano Modesti.\r\n\r\nN\u00e9 en France mais r\u00e9sidant \u00e0 Bombay, Maximiliano Modesti vit depuis 2015 une partie de l\u2019ann\u00e9e \u00e0 Bruxelles. En 2012, il rencontrait Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle lors de l\u2019India Art Fair et fondait, en 2016 \u00e0 Lucknow, le Kalhath Institute, un centre de formation, documentation d\u00e9di\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019artisanat mill\u00e9naire indien de la broderie.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com\/","email":"press@sophiecarree.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541727"},"nl":{"name":"Regards Crois\u00e9s : Een dubbele jubileumtentoonstelling","shortdescr":"In Brussel presenteert Laurent Jacob, in de Modesti Perdriolle Gallery en onder de noemer Regards Crois\u00e9s, een keur aan Belgische kunstenaars: schilders Marc Angeli en Michel Boulanger, en de beeldende kunstenaars Roberta Gigante en Patrick Regout. Om de verschillen tussen hun werk te accentueren stellen ze een uitzonderlijke compositie voor van Ethiopische wandelstokken.","longdescr":"Een jaar geleden opende de Modesti Perdriolle Gallery haar deuren met de tentoonstelling Contemporary, One Word, Several Worlds. De titel verwijst naar een gemeenschappelijke benadering van het artistieke aspect en van de toekomstige programmering, en dit voor een huis dat zijn eerste kaarsje uitblaast met een dubbelevenement!\r\n \r\nDe ontmoeting met de Luikse curator Laurent Jacob leidde tot een dubbele expo in Luik en Brussel onder de naam Regards Crois\u00e9s. Die toont het horizontale karakter van de blik op deze twee artistieke ervaringen: die van Jacob en die van Perdriolle, beide \u201cfans van vrijgevochten personages, vooral als ze zich in een spagaat bevinden.\u201d\r\n\r\n___\r\nOp 9 september 2021 heeft Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle, de Franse verzamelaar, kunstcriticus en curator die sinds 2019 in Brussel is gevestigd, samen met ondernemer Maximiliano Modesti een permanente tentoonstellingsruimte ingewijd.\r\n \r\nMaximiliano Modesti werd geboren in Frankrijk maar woont in Bombay, en sinds 2015 ook deels in Brussel. In 2012, tijdens de India Art Fair, maakte hij kennis met Perdriolle. In 2016 richtte hij in Lucknow het Kalhath Institute, een opleidings- en documentatiecentrum op, gewijd aan het eeuwenoude en ambachtelijk Indische borduurwerk.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541727"},"en":{"name":"Regards Crois\u00e9s : A double anniversary exhibition","shortdescr":"In Brussels, at the Modesti Perdriolle Gallery and under the banner Regards Crois\u00e9s, Laurent Jacob presents a selection of Belgian artists: painters Marc Angeli and Michel Boulanger, and visual artists Roberta Gigante and Patrick Regout. To highlight the differences between their work, they present an exceptional composition of Ethiopian walking sticks.","longdescr":"A year ago, the Modesti Perdriolle Gallery began showing the exhibition\r\nentitled \u201cContemporary, One Word, Several Worlds\u201d, which symbolised a\r\nshared approach to art and the future planning of a brand that is celebrating its\r\nfirst birthday with a double event!\r\n\r\nThis double exhibition - the result of an encounter with Li\u00e8ge-based curator\r\nLaurent Jacob - will take place in Li\u00e8ge and Brussels under the title Regards\r\nCrois\u00e9s. It offers a transversal view of two artistic experiences: those of Laurent\r\nJacob and of Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle, both of whom are \"lovers of free figures in\r\ngeneral, and of the great divide in particular\u201d. \r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nOn 9 September 2021, French collector, art critic and curator Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle, who\r\nhas been living in Brussels since 2019, opened a permanent exhibition space, together\r\nwith entrepreneur Maximiliano Modesti.\r\n\r\nBorn in France, but a resident of Mumbai, Maximiliano Modesti has lived in Brussels\r\nfor part of the year since 2015. He met Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle in 2012 at the India Art Fair,\r\nand in 2016 founded the Kalhath Institute in Lucknow - a training and\r\ndocumentation centre dedicated to the age-old Indian craft of embroidery.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541727"},"de":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery c\u00e9l\u00e8bre son premier anniversaire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541727"},"it":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery c\u00e9l\u00e8bre son premier anniversaire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541727"},"sp":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery c\u00e9l\u00e8bre son premier anniversaire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541727"},"pt":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery c\u00e9l\u00e8bre son premier anniversaire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541727"},"cn":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery c\u00e9l\u00e8bre son premier anniversaire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541727"}},"place":{"id":274938,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"+32 492 31 01 19","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Modesti Perdriolle","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery","address_street_name":"Sint-Jorisstraat","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"+32 492 31 01 19","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Sint-Jorisstraat, 27","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"+32 492 31 01 19","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Max Modesti and Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle met in 2012 at the India Art Fair in New Delhi. Both share a passion for India. Their paths have often crossed, in India as in France, mainly around emerging Indian artists that the first collects and that the second exhibits. Both leave Paris for Brussels,\r\n\r\nMax in 2015, Herv\u00e9 in 2019. It was during their wanderings and discussions in Brussels that the idea of opening a gallery was born.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\"Art is what makes life more interesting than art\", this quote from\r\n\r\nRobert Filliou also illustrates what unites Max Modesti and\r\n\r\nHerv\u00e9 Perdriolle, a pronounced taste for the encounters and adventures that the art world arouses.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Galerie Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"+32 492 31 01 19","pho