alse}},"translations":{"fr":["lundi, mardi et dimanche: ferm\u00e9","mercredi, jeudi et vendredi: de 14:00 \u00e0 18:00","samedi: de 11:00 \u00e0 18:00"],"nl":["maandag, dinsdag en zondag: gesloten","woensdag, donderdag en vrijdag: van 14:00 tot 18:00","zaterdag: van 11:00 tot 18:00"],"en":["monday, tuesday and sunday: closed","wednesday, thursday and friday: from 14:00 to 18:00","saturday: from 11:00 to 18:00"]},"date_start":"2022-09-08","date_end":"2022-10-29","is_also_by_appointment":true}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"opening":{"day":"2022-09-10","start":"11:00:00","timestamp":"2022-09-10T11:00:00+02:00","end":"19:00:00","is_only_by_appointment":false},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-30T01:36:47+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-14T08:46:14+02:00","backoffice_id":261727,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.33755319058958},{"id":538549,"date_start":"2022-09-16","date_end":"2022-11-06","date_next":"2022-09-30","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,44],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Design"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Design"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Design"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Sep Verboom x Lampirong","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez le projet Lampirong du designer Sep Verboom dans la vitrine MAD!","longdescr":"Il y a quelques ann\u00e9es le designer industriel Sep Verboom (\u00b01990) a fond\u00e9 le collectif Livable. Il s'agit d'une plateforme o\u00f9 les histoires des communaut\u00e9s et les mat\u00e9riaux int\u00e9ressants sont regroup\u00e9s et o\u00f9 les autres designers et l'industrie sont impliqu\u00e9s. Le projet Lampirong correspond \u00e9galement \u00e0 cette plate-forme. Le Lampirong, connu sous le nom d'hu\u00eetre de Capiz, se trouve en abondance autour de la capitale des Philippines. C'est le seul coquillage transparent. Ces derniers \u00e9taient un pr\u00e9curseur florissant du verre, utilis\u00e9 pour fabriquer des fen\u00eatres coulissantes pendant l'occupation espagnole au XIXe si\u00e8cle. En tant que filtres, les coquillages peuvent purifier jusqu'\u00e0 40 litres par heure en mangeant le plancton et les d\u00e9chets organiques des rivi\u00e8res en amont. Cela leur conf\u00e8re une place importante dans l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me local. Malheureusement, les coquillages vivent une \u00e9poque turbulente. La p\u00eache de fond, le r\u00e9chauffement des eaux et les courants plus forts r\u00e9duisent les populations. Les communaut\u00e9s en d\u00e9pendent pour leurs moyens de subsistance et un environnement propre. Le projet Lampirong est une invitation \u00e0 repenser l'utilisation des coquillages Capiz, afin de prot\u00e9ger et d'am\u00e9liorer l'ensemble de l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538549"},"nl":{"name":"Sep Verboom x Lampirong","shortdescr":"Ontdek het het Lampirong project van designer Sep Verboom in de MAD vitrine!","longdescr":"Industrieel ontwerper Sep Verboom (\u00b01990) richtte een paar jaar geleden het collectief Livable op. Een platform waar verhalen van gemeenschappen en interessante materialen worden gebundeld en waar zowel andere ontwerpers als de industrie worden bij betrokken. Ook het Lampirong project past qua karakter op dit platform. De Lampirong, ook bekend als de Capiz oester, is in overvloed te vinden rond de zeevruchtenhoofdstad van de Filippijnen. Het is de enige transparante schelp. Deze waren ooit een bloeiende voorloper van glas, gebruikt om schuiframen te maken tijdens de Spaanse bezetting in de 19de eeuw. Als filters kunnen de schelpen tot 40 liter per uur zuiveren door plankton en organisch afval uit de stroomopwaarts gelegen rivieren te eten. Hierdoor nemen ze een belangrijke plaats in in het lokale ecosysteem. Helaas leven de schelpen in woelige tijden. Bodemvisserij, opwarmende wateren en sterkere stromingen doen de populaties afnemen. De gemeenschappen zijn ervan afhankelijk voor hun levensonderhoud en een schoon milieu. Het Lampirong project is een uitnodiging om het gebruik van de Capiz schelpen te herzien, om het hele ecosysteem te beschermen en te stimuleren.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/sep-verboom-x-lampirong","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538549"},"en":{"name":"Sep Verboom x Lampirong","shortdescr":"Discover the Lampirong project of designer Sep Verboom in the MAD showcase!","longdescr":"Industrial designer Sep Verboom (\u00b01990) founded the collective Livable a few years ago. A platform where stories of communities and interesting materials are bundled and where both designers and the industry are involved. The Lampirong project also fits into this platform in terms of character. The Lampirong, also known as the Capiz oyster, is found in abundance around the seafood capital of the Philippines. It is the only transparent shell. These were once a thriving precursor to glass, used to make sliding windows during the Spanish occupation in the 19th century. As filters, the shells can purify up to 40 liters per hour by eating plankton and organic waste from upstream rivers. As a result, they occupy an important place in the local ecosystem. Unfortunately, the clams live in turbulent times. Bottom fishing, warming waters and stronger currents are reducing populations. Communities depend on them for their livelihoods and a clean environment. The Lampirong project is an invitation to rethink the use of Capiz shells, to protect and enhance the entire ecosystem.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538549"},"de":{"name":"Sep Verboom x Lampirong","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538549"},"it":{"name":"Sep Verboom x Lampirong","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538549"},"sp":{"name":"Sep Verboom x Lampirong","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538549"},"pt":{"name":"Sep Verboom x Lampirong","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538549"},"cn":{"name":"Sep Verboom x Lampirong","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538549"}},"place":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Plac