"en":["monday, tuesday and sunday: closed","wednesday, thursday and friday: from 12:00 to 18:00","saturday: from 14:00 to 18:00"]},"date_start":"2022-09-09","date_end":"2022-10-08","is_also_by_appointment":true}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"opening":{"day":"2022-09-08","start":"17:00:00","timestamp":"2022-09-08T17:00:00+02:00","end":"21:00:00","is_only_by_appointment":false},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-30T02:05:52+02:00","published_at":"2022-08-08T12:02:05+02:00","backoffice_id":259394,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.32182979486854},{"id":536180,"date_start":"2022-09-09","date_end":"2023-01-08","date_next":"2022-09-30","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,37],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Arts audiovisuels"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Audiovisuele kunst"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Audiovisual art"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Shimabuku - Instrumental","shortdescr":"L\u2019art peut-il \u00eatre instrumental ou utile ? L\u2019\u0153uvre de Shimabuku donne \u00e0 cette question r\u00e9currente une tournure absurde tout en r\u00e9affirmant le r\u00f4le essentiel de l\u2019art au c\u0153ur de l\u2019imagination.","longdescr":"Le travail de Shimabuku renverse notre regard sur la vie quotidienne. Il nous permet de voir les choses sous de nouvelles perspectives infus\u00e9es d\u2019un humour surr\u00e9aliste et une beaut\u00e9 ludique. Adoptant diff\u00e9rentes formes \u2013 des objets transform\u00e9s aux actions document\u00e9es sous formes de vid\u00e9os et souvent accompagn\u00e9es de courts textes po\u00e9tiques \u2013 les projets de Shimabuku r\u00e9v\u00e8lent sa curiosit\u00e9 et r\u00e9veille la n\u00f4tre. Pour cette exposition, sa premi\u00e8re en Belgique, Shimabuku pr\u00e9sente une s\u00e9lection d\u2019\u0153uvres r\u00e9centes accompagn\u00e9e de pi\u00e8ces moins connues ou rarement montr\u00e9es.\r\n\r\nInstrumental, le titre de l\u2019exposition, souligne l\u2019importance de la musique pour Shimabuku. En t\u00e9moigne le r\u00f4le central qu\u2019elle prend dans les vid\u00e9os pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es. Le titre \u00e9voque \u00e9galement les nombreux instruments cr\u00e9\u00e9s par l\u2019artiste, allant des outils manuels, aux inventions ing\u00e9nieuses en passant par des instruments de musique. Il d\u00e9tourne par exemple l\u2019arc d\u2019un archer pour jouer de la contrebasse et transforme ainsi un instrument guerrier en instrument de Jazz.\r\n\r\nCuratrice : Zo\u00eb Gray","performers":"Shimabuku","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","email":"welcome@wiels.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 350 00 53","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536180"},"nl":{"name":"Shimabuku - Instrumental","shortdescr":"Kan kunst instrumenteel of nuttig zijn? Shimabuku\u2019s oeuvre geeft een absurde draai aan de terugkerende vraag terwijl hij de essenti\u00eble rol van kunst in het rijk van de verbeelding herbevestigd.","longdescr":"Het werk van Shimabuku draait onze visie op de wereld helemaal ondersteboven en laat ons toe om opnieuw te kijken vanuit een ander perspectief, doordrenkt met surre\u00eble humor en speelse schoonheid. In verschillende vormen \u2013 van getransformeerde objecten tot acties die gedocumenteerd zijn op video, vaak vergezeld van korte po\u00ebtische teksten \u2013 onthullen Shimabuku\u2019s projecten zijn nieuwsgierigheid naar de wereld en ontwaken de onze. In deze tentoonstelling, zijn eerste in Belgi\u00eb, presenteert Shimabuku een selectie van zijn meest recente werken samen met minder bekende of zelden getoonde creaties.\r\n\r\nDe titel van de tentoonstelling Instrumental benadrukt het belang van muziek voor Shimabuku, zoals aangetoond met de centrale rol in de getoonde videos. Daarbij refereert het ook naar de vele instrumenten die Shimabuku cre\u00ebert, van gereedschappen en geniale uitvindingen tot functionele muziekinstrumenten: een boogschutters boog wordt gebruikt, bijvoorbeeld, om de contrabas te bespelen, een oorlogsinstrument wordt zo een jazzinstrument.\r\n\r\nCuratrice: Zo\u00eb Gray","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536180"},"en":{"name":"Shimabuku - Instrumental","shortdescr":"Can art be instrumental or useful? Shimabuku\u2019s work gives this recurrent demand an absurd spin, while reaffirming art\u2019s essential role in the realm of the imagination.","longdescr":"Shimabuku's work turns our view of daily life on its head, enabling us to see things from a new perspective, infused with surreal humour and playful beauty. Taking various forms \u2013 from transformed objects to actions documented on video, often accompanied by short poetic texts \u2013 Shimabuku\u2019s engaging projects reveal his curiosity about the world and awaken ours. For his WIELS exhibition, his first in Belgium, Shimabuku presents a selection of recent works, together with little-known or rarely shown existing pieces.\r\n\r\nThe exhibition\u2019s title Instrumental highlights the importance of music for Shimabuku, as evidenced by its central role in the videos shown here. It also evokes the many instruments that Shimabuku creates, from manual tools and ingenious inventions to functioning musical instruments: for example, using an archer\u2019s bow to play the double bass, transforming an instrument of war to play jazz.\r\n\r\nCurator: Zo\u00eb Gray","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536180"},"de":{"name":"Shimabuku - Instrumental","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536180"},"it":{"name":"Shimabuku - Instrumental","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536180"},"sp":{"name":"Shimabuku - Instrumental","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536180"},"pt":{"name":"Shimabuku - Instrumental","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536180"},"cn":{"name":"Shimabuku - Instrumental","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536180"}},"place":{"id":1490,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Wiels - Centre d\u2019art contemporain","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"La r\u00e9servation est obligatoire pour le Wiels. Veuillez vous rendre sur leur site internet pour une r\u00e9servation.\r\n\r\nLe WIELS est un laboratoire international pour la cr\u00e9ation et la diffusion de l\u2019art contemporain. Ax\u00e9 sur les arts visuels, mais accordant une place et une attention particuli\u00e8res aux croisements et interactions avec d\u2019autres disciplines, le centre d\u00e9sire pr\u00e9senter l\u2019art contemporain dans toute sa diversit\u00e9 et mettre le public en contact et en dialogue permanents avec les d\u00e9veloppements et d\u00e9bats les plus r\u00e9cents du monde de l\u2019art.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"WIELS - CONTEMPORARY ART CENTRE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Wiels - Centrum voor hedendaagse kunst","address_street_name":"Van Volxemlaan","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Van Volxemlaan, 354","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"De boeking is verplicht voor Wiels. Raadpleeg de webpagina van de musea om te reserveren.\r\n\r\nWiels is een toonaangevend internationaal platform voor de creatie en presentatie van hedendaagse kunst. Het centrum ontwikkelt een programma van tijdelijke activiteiten, zonder een permanente collectie uit te bouwen. Wiels organiseert zes tot acht grote tentoonstellingen per jaar die de evoluties in hedendaagse kunst op de voet volgen. Daarnaast loopt er een residentie en educatief programma en worden er lezingen, films, performances, debatten, ontmoetingen georganiseerd.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"WIELS - CONTEMPORARY ART CENTRE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Wiels - Contemporary art centre","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Booking is compulsory for Wiels. Please consult the museum\u2019s website to book your time slot.\r\n\r\nIt was the brewer L\u00e9on Wielemans who asked his friend, the architect Adrien Blomme, to design and build the new buildings of his brewery in Forest. It became the leading monument of industrial archaeology in the art deco style, and houses now Wiels, an international laboratory for the creation and the diffusion of contemporary art. Focusing on visual arts, but granting a particular attention to the crossings and interactions with other disciplines, the centre wishes to present contemporary art in all its diversity and to offer a permanent dialogue with the developments and the most recent debates of the art world.  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"WIELS - CONTEMPORARY ART CENTRE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Wiels - Zentrum f\u00fcr moderne Kunst","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Das WIELS ist ein hochkar\u00e4tiges, internationales Labor f\u00fcr moderne Kunst, das sich nicht nur der Ausstellung von moderner Kunst sondern auch dem kreativen Entstehungsprozess widmet. Der Schwerpunkt liegt auf der visuellen Kunst, doch es werden auch ganz bewusst Schnittstellen mit anderen Disziplinen gesucht, die die Vielfalt und das Facettenreichtum der modernen Kunst aufzuzeigen. Dem Besucher offenbart sich ein permanenter Dialog mit den Entwicklungen der modernen Kunst und eine Debatte mit der Kunstwelt der Gegenwart.\r\n\r\nAuf drei Ebenen mit insgesamt 1800 m\u00b2 Ausstellungsfl\u00e4che finden regelm\u00e4\u00dfig Ausstellungen statt. Dar\u00fcber hinaus wird das WIELS regelm\u00e4\u00dfig Schauplatz von ausgew\u00e4hlten Filmvorf\u00fchrungen, Konferenzen, Festivals und Konzerten. \r\n\r\nUntergebracht ist das WIELS in dem eindrucksvollen Eckgeb\u00e4ude der ehemaligen Brauerei Wielemans-Ceuppens, das aus der Feder des modernistischen Architekten Adrien Blomm stammt. Von der Brauereivergangenheit zeugen noch heute die majest\u00e4tischen Kupferkessel.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Wiels - Centre d\u2019art contemporain","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Wiels - Centro de arte contempor\u00e1neo","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Fue el amante de la cerveza L\u00e9on Wielemans quien le pidi\u00f3 a su amigo, el arquitecto Adrien Blomme, dise\u00f1ar y construir los nuevos edificios para su cervecer\u00eda en Forest. Se convirti\u00f3 en el monumento m\u00e1s importante de arqueolog\u00eda industrial en estilo art d\u00e9co, y ahora alberga Wiels, un laboratorio internacional para la creaci\u00f3n y difusi\u00f3n de arte contempor\u00e1neo. Poniendo el foco en las artes visuales, pero garantizando una particular atenci\u00f3n en el cruce y las interacciones con otras disciplinas, el centro pretende mostrar el arte contempor\u00e1neo en todos sus sentidos y ofrecer un di\u00e1logo permanente con su desarrollo y los debates m\u00e1s recientes del mundo del arte.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Wiels - Centre d\u2019art contemporain","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Wiels - Centre d\u2019art contemporain","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":195,"location":{"lat":50.82467444,"lon":4.32636558},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-30T01:08:24+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:21+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":1490,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Wiels - Centre d\u2019art contemporain","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"La r\u00e9servation est obligatoire pour le Wiels. Veuillez vous rendre sur leur site internet pour une r\u00e9servation.\r\n\r\nLe WIELS est un laboratoire international pour la cr\u00e9ation et la diffusion de l\u2019art contemporain. Ax\u00e9 sur les arts visuels, mais accordant une place et une attention particuli\u00e8res aux croisements et interactions avec d\u2019autres disciplines, le centre d\u00e9sire pr\u00e9senter l\u2019art contemporain dans toute sa diversit\u00e9 et mettre le public en contact et en dialogue permanents avec les d\u00e9veloppements et d\u00e9bats les plus r\u00e9cents du monde de l\u2019art.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"WIELS - CONTEMPORARY ART CENTRE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Wiels - Centrum voor hedendaagse kunst","address_street_name":"Van Volxemlaan","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Van Volxemlaan, 354","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"De boeking is verplicht voor Wiels. Raadpleeg de webpagina van de musea om te reserveren.\r\n\r\nWiels is een toonaangevend internationaal platform voor de creatie en presentatie van hedendaagse kunst. Het centrum ontwikkelt een programma van tijdelijke activiteiten, zonder een permanente collectie uit te bouwen. Wiels organiseert zes tot acht grote tentoonstellingen per jaar die de evoluties in hedendaagse kunst op de voet volgen. Daarnaast loopt er een residentie en educatief programma en worden er lezingen, films, performances, debatten, ontmoetingen georganiseerd.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"WIELS - CONTEMPORARY ART CENTRE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Wiels - Contemporary art centre","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Booking is compulsory for Wiels. Please consult the museum\u2019s website to book your time slot.\r\n\r\nIt was the brewer L\u00e9on Wielemans who asked his friend, the architect Adrien Blomme, to design and build the new buildings of his brewery in Forest. It became the leading monument of industrial archaeology in the art deco style, and houses now Wiels, an international laboratory for the creation and the diffusion of contemporary art. Focusing on visual arts, but granting a particular attention to the crossings and interactions with other disciplines, the centre wishes to present contemporary art in all its diversity and to offer a permanent dialogue with the developments and the most recent debates of the art world.  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"WIELS - CONTEMPORARY ART CENTRE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Wiels - Zentrum f\u00fcr moderne Kunst","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Das WIELS ist ein hochkar\u00e4tiges, internationales Labor f\u00fcr moderne Kunst, das sich nicht nur der Ausstellung von moderner Kunst sondern auch dem kreativen Entstehungsprozess widmet. Der Schwerpunkt liegt auf der visuellen Kunst, doch es werden auch ganz bewusst Schnittstellen mit anderen Disziplinen gesucht, die die Vielfalt und das Facettenreichtum der modernen Kunst aufzuzeigen. Dem Besucher offenbart sich ein permanenter Dialog mit den Entwicklungen der modernen Kunst und eine Debatte mit der Kunstwelt der Gegenwart.\r\n\r\nAuf drei Ebenen mit insgesamt 1800 m\u00b2 Ausstellungsfl\u00e4che finden regelm\u00e4\u00dfig Ausstellungen statt. Dar\u00fcber hinaus wird das WIELS regelm\u00e4\u00dfig Schauplatz von ausgew\u00e4hlten Filmvorf\u00fchrungen, Konferenzen, Festivals und Konzerten. \r\n\r\nUntergebracht ist das WIELS in dem eindrucksvollen Eckgeb\u00e4ude der ehemaligen Brauerei Wielemans-Ceuppens, das aus der Feder des modernistischen Architekten Adrien Blomm stammt. Von der Brauereivergangenheit zeugen noch heute die majest\u00e4tischen Kupferkessel.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Wiels - Centre d\u2019art contemporain","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Wiels - Centro de arte contempor\u00e1neo","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Fue el amante de la cerveza L\u00e9on Wielemans quien le pidi\u00f3 a su amigo, el arquitecto Adrien Blomme, dise\u00f1ar y construir los nuevos edificios para su cervecer\u00eda en Forest. Se convirti\u00f3 en el monumento m\u00e1s importante de arqueolog\u00eda industrial en estilo art d\u00e9co, y ahora alberga Wiels, un laboratorio internacional para la creaci\u00f3n y difusi\u00f3n de arte contempor\u00e1neo. Poniendo el foco en las artes visuales, pero garantizando una particular atenci\u00f3n en el cruce y las interacciones con otras disciplinas, el centro pretende mostrar el arte contempor\u00e1neo en todos sus sentidos y ofrecer un di\u00e1logo permanente con su desarrollo y los debates m\u00e1s recientes del mundo del arte.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Wiels - Centre d\u2019art contemporain","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Wiels - Centre d\u2019art contemporain","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"354","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@wiels.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 354","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":195,"location":{"lat":50.82467444,"lon":4.32636558},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-30T01:08:24+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:21+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":