russels, the Jewish Museum of Belgium takes a fresh look at Jewish history and culture through exhibitions and activities focusing on sharing, discovery and accessibility for all sectors of the public. \r\n \r\nFirmly anchored in the present day, it is an artistic and cultural place that is lively, dynamic and multidisciplinary, led by a team that values openness, boldness and modernity, and whose goal is to promote a knowledge and understanding of Jewish history, religion and culture.\r\n \r\nThrough its three principal missions, namely the preservation of Jewish heritage in Belgium, temporary exhibitions reflecting topical subjects and educational activities for school groups, the team is gradually constructing the public face of the New Museum that will open its doors by 2025.\r\n \r\nPending the start of work, visitors can discover a selection of the permanent collection as well as several temporary exhibitions in two buildings covering a total area of five floors. At the same time, the Museum organises a wide range of activities such as conferences, concerts, workshops and literary evenings.","description_print":"","booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=MJBJMB&s=36A988BE-3AFB-C330-4390-561429852E3D&lg=EN","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Juif de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue des Minimes","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mjb-jmb.org","website":"http:\/\/www.mjb-jmb.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 19 63","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Minimes, 21","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das J\u00fcdische Museum Belgiens im Sablon-Viertel wirft anhand von Ausstellungen und Aktivit\u00e4ten einen Blick auf die j\u00fcdische Geschichte und Kultur. \r\n\r\nAls lebendiger und dynamischer Ort der Kultur und der Kunst m\u00f6chte das Museum Wissen und Verst\u00e4ndnis f\u00fcr die Geschichte des j\u00fcdischen Glaubens und der Kulturen vermitteln. \r\n\r\nDie drei wichtigsten Missionen sind hierbei die Bewahrung des j\u00fcdischen Kulturguts in Belgien, Wechselausstellungen zu aktuellen Themen sowie Konferenzen, Konzerte, Workshops und Literaturabende.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Juif de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue des Minimes","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mjb-jmb.org","website":"http:\/\/www.mjb-jmb.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 19 63","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Minimes, 21","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Juif de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue des Minimes","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mjb-jmb.org","website":"http:\/\/www.mjb-jmb.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 19 63","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Minimes, 21","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Juif de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue des Minimes","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mjb-jmb.org","website":"http:\/\/www.mjb-jmb.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 19 63","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Minimes, 21","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Juif de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue des Minimes","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mjb-jmb.org","website":"http:\/\/www.mjb-jmb.org","