sion","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour les personnes aveugles et malvoyantes","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-07T01:07:58+02:00","published_at":"2022-03-17T08:46:28+01:00","backoffice_id":244441,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"misc","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.22810949522835},{"id":505632,"date_start":"2020-10-13","date_end":"2022-12-29","date_next":"2022-10-04","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations"}},"others":{"list":[95],"translations":{"fr":["Patrimoine"],"nl":["Erfgoed"],"en":["Heritage"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Murder Mystery Teambuilding","shortdescr":"Bruxelles, 1521. Lors de festivit\u00e9s c\u00e9l\u00e9br\u00e9es au palais du Coudenberg, un important personnage d\u00e9c\u00e8de dans d\u2019\u00e9tranges circonstances.\r\nDes si\u00e8cles plus tard, des fant\u00f4mes hantent d\u00e9sormais les vestiges du palais. Et s\u2019il y avait un myst\u00e8re \u00e0 r\u00e9soudre\u00a0? Oserez-vous plonger dans les souterrains pour d\u00e9couvrir la v\u00e9rit\u00e9\u00a0?","longdescr":"Bruxelles, 1521. Lors de festivit\u00e9s c\u00e9l\u00e9br\u00e9es au palais du Coudenberg, un important personnage d\u00e9c\u00e8de dans d\u2019\u00e9tranges circonstances. Des si\u00e8cles plus tard, des fant\u00f4mes hantent d\u00e9sormais les vestiges du palais.\r\nEt s\u2019il y avait un myst\u00e8re \u00e0 r\u00e9soudre ? Oserez-vous plonger dans les souterrains pour d\u00e9couvrir la v\u00e9rit\u00e9 ?\r\n\r\nLe Murder Mystery est une activit\u00e9 de type teambuilding se d\u00e9roulant dans les vestiges du Palais du Coudenberg, au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, sous la place Royale. Le temps d\u2019une soir\u00e9e, venez d\u00e9couvrir ce lieu unique \u00e0 travers une enqu\u00eate passionnante pleine de rebondissements et de personnages hauts en couleur.\r\nM\u00ealant r\u00e9flexion, observation et travail d\u2019\u00e9quipe, c\u2019est l\u2019activit\u00e9 id\u00e9ale pour un teambuilding !\r\n\r\nO\u00f9 ?\r\nAu Palais du Coudenberg, site arch\u00e9ologique situ\u00e9 sous la Place Royale, \u00e0 Bruxelles (entr\u00e9e par le 10 place Royale).\r\n\r\nQuand ?\r\nL\u2019activit\u00e9 peut \u00eatre r\u00e9serv\u00e9e tous les mardis et jeudis (\u00e0 l\u2019exception des jours f\u00e9ri\u00e9s) de 17h \u00e0 20h30.\r\n\r\nComment ?\r\nLes joueurs sont r\u00e9partis en groupes et organis\u00e9s selon des shifts d\u2019arriv\u00e9e toutes les dix minutes. Apr\u00e8s un briefing avec le ma\u00eetre du jeu, ils ont 2 heures 30 pour parcourir le site et percer ses secrets ! Pour ce faire, ils doivent r\u00e9colter des indices et des t\u00e9moignages \u00e0 l\u2019aide de QR codes diss\u00e9min\u00e9s \u00e0 travers les vestiges.\r\n\r\nCombien ?\r\n- Moins de 50 personnes : Forfait de 400 \u20ac pour la privatisation du site auquel il faut ajouter un tarif de 20 \u20ac par personne\r\n\r\n- Au-del\u00e0 de 50 personnes : Forfait de 600 \u20ac pour la privatisation du site auquel il faut ajouter un tarif de 20 \u20ac par personne\r\n\r\nDisponible en Fran\u00e7ais, N\u00e9erlandais et Anglais.\r\nSous-titres FR, NL et EN disponibles pour les personnes sourdes et malentendantes.\r\n\r\nInfo et r\u00e9servation : https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/nl\/bezoek-en-activiteiten\/murder-mystery-teambuilding","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.505632"},"nl":{"name":"Murder Mystery Teambuilding","shortdescr":"Brussel, 1521, terwijl een feest volop aan de gang is in het Coudenbergpaleis, overlijdt een belangrijk personage in bizarre omstandigheden. Eeuwen later dwalen de geesten van de feestvierders rond in de overblijfselen van het paleis. Is er die bewuste nacht iets gebeurd dat het daglicht niet mocht zien? Daal af in de ru\u00efnes van het paleis en ontrafel de ware toedracht achter het mysterie.","longdescr":"Brussel, 1521, terwijl een feest volop aan de gang is in het Coudenbergpaleis, overlijdt een belangrijk personage in bizarre omstandigheden. Eeuwen later dwalen de geesten van de feestvierders rond in de overblijfselen van het paleis.\r\nIs er die bewuste nacht misschien iets gebeurd dat het daglicht niet mocht zien? Durf jij af te dalen in de ru\u00efnes van het paleis om de ware toedracht achter het mysterie te ontrafelen?\r\n\r\nDe Murder Mystery Game is een teambuilding die zich afspeelt in de overblijfselen van het Coudenbergpaleis, in het hart van Brussel, onder het Koningsplein. Ontdek deze unieke plek terwijl je een fascinerend onderzoek voert vol wendingen en kleurrijke personages. Door de combinatie van reflectie, observatie en samenwerking is dit een ideale activiteit voor een teambuilding!\r\n\r\nWaar?\r\nIn het Coudenbergpaleis, een archeologische site onder het Koningsplein in Brussel (ingang via Koningsplein 10).\r\n\r\nWanneer?\r\nDe activiteit kan gereserveerd worden op dinsdag en donderdag (uitgezonderd feestdagen) van 17u tot 20u30.\r\n\r\nHoe?\r\nDe deelnemers worden in groepen opgedeeld, elke 10 minuten vertrekt er een groepje. Na een briefing van de spelleider hebben ze 2u30 de tijd om de site te doorzoeken en de geheimen ervan te ontdekken! Om het mysterie op te lossen, moeten ze aanwijzingen en getuigenissen verzamelen. Deze zijn in de vorm QR-codes verspreid in de archeologische site.\r\n\r\nHoeveel?\r\n- Minder dan 50 personen: Vaste prijs van \u20ac400 voor de privatisering van de site plus \u20ac20 per persoon\r\n\r\n- Vanaf 50 personen\r\nVaste prijs van \u20ac600 voor de privatisering van de site plus \u20ac20 per persoon\r\n\r\nBeschikbaar in Nederlands, Frans en Engels.\r\nNL, FR en EN ondertitels zijn voorzien voor doven en slechthorenden.\r\n\r\nInfo en reservatie: https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/nl\/bezoek-en-activiteiten\/murder-mystery-teambuilding","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/nl\/bezoek-en-activiteiten\/murder-mystery-teambuilding","email":"g.breny@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.505632"},"en":{"name":"Murder Mystery Teambuilding","shortdescr":"Brussels, 1521. During festivities at Coudenberg Palace, an important person dies in strange circumstances. Centuries later, ghosts now haunt the remains of the palace.\r\nWhat if there was a mystery to be solved? Would you dare to plunge underground to discover the truth?","longdescr":"Brussels, 1521. During festivities at Coudenberg Palace, an important person dies in strange circumstances. Centuries later, ghosts now haunt the remains of the palace.\r\nWhat if there was a mystery to be solved? Would you dare to plunge underground to discover the truth?\r\n\r\nThe Murder Mystery is a teambuilding activity taking place in the remains of Coudenberg Palace in the heart of Brussels, under the Place Royale. For one evening, come and discover this unique place through an exciting investigation full of twists and turns and colourful characters.\r\nCombining reflection, observation and teamwork, this is the ideal activity for teambuilding!\r\n\r\nWhere?\r\nAt Coudenberg Palace, an archaeological site located under Place Royale, in Brussels (entrance from 10 Place Royale).\r\n\r\nWhen?\r\nThe activity can be booked every Tuesday and Thursday (except public holidays) from 5pm to 8.30pm.\r\n\r\nHow?\r\nPlayers are divided into groups and organised according to arrival shifts every ten minutes. After a briefing with the game master, they have 2.5 hours to explore the site and discover its secrets! To do so, they must collect clues and testimonials using QR codes scattered throughout the remains.\r\n\r\nHow much?\r\n- Less than 50 people: Fixed price of 400 \u20ac for the privatization of the site to which a fee of 20 \u20ac per person must be added\r\n\r\n- More than 50 people: Fixed price of 600 \u20ac for the privatization of the site to which a fee of 20 \u20ac per person must be added\r\n\r\nAvailable in English, French and Dutch.\r\nEN,\u00a0FR and NL subtitles available for deaf and hard of hearing people.\r\n\r\nInfo and reservation via https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/nl\/bezoek-en-activiteiten\/murder-mystery-teambuilding","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.505632"},"de":{"name":"Murder Mystery Teambuilding","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.505632"},"it":{"name":"Murder Mystery Teambuilding","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.505632"},"sp":{"name":"Murder Mystery Teambuilding","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.505632"},"pt":{"name":"Murder Mystery Teambuilding","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.505632"},"cn":{"name":"Murder Mystery Teambuilding","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.505632"}},"place":{"id":258195,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die arch\u00e4ologische St\u00e4tte des Coudenberg. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Palazzo","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\"Il sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\tSito Archeologico di Coudenbergl sito...\"\r\n\r\nIl sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nSito Archeologico di Coudenberg\r\n\r\nl sito riunisce vestigia dell'antico palazzo di Bruxelles, della residenza di Hoogstraeten e della Rue Isabelle. Un'affascinante passeggiata che vi conduce sotto il pav\u00e9 della place Royale, alla scoperta dei resti del Palazzo di Coudenberg che fu una delle residenze principali di Carlo V. \u00a0\r\n\r\nMuseo del Coudenberg\r\nil museo vi invita a scoprire un'esposizione permanente di oggetti trovati durante gli scavi effettuati sul sito negli ultimi 25 anni. potete combinare la vostra visita con quella del Museo BELvue.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palacio","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"En el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas....\r\n\r\nEn el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg est\u00e1 compuesto de vestigios del antiguo Palacio de Bruselas, del Hotel Hoogstraeten y de la Rue Isabelle.\u00a0Este fascinante paseo te llevar\u00e1 a descubrir los <b>vestigios del Palacio Coudenberg<\/b>, que fue una de las residencias de Carlos V.\r\n\r\nMuseo Coudenberg\r\n\r\nInstalado en los vestigios del antiguo Hotel de Hoogstraeten, el Museo Coudenberg  te invita a descubrir una <b>exposici\u00f3n permanente<\/b> de objetos hallados durante las distintas <b>excavaciones arqueol\u00f3gicas<\/b> realizadas los \u00faltimos 25 a\u00f1os.\u00a0Podr\u00e1s combinar tu visita del Coudenberg con la del Museo BELvue.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[16],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier Royal"],"nl":["Koninklijke wijk"],"en":["Royal"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":18195,"location":{"lat":50.84261029,"lon":4.36068879},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-30T01:08:59+02:00","published_at":"2014-05-05T10:58:29+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":227859,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n\r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. \r\n\r\nPlongez dans l'histoire prestigieuse de Bruxelles et de son palais !\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. \r\n\r\nVele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt. \r\n\r\nLaat je onderdompelen in de prestigieuze geschiedenis van Brussel en zijn paleis!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire. Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archaeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n\r\nDuring a visit, explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground. \r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the prestigious history of Brussels and its palace!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Palazzo Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Con un' impressionante esposizione, questo sito archeologico rivela i resti del palazzo  dei duchi di Burgundye l'Aula Magna di Carlo V, oltre ad edifici e strade che ormai si trovano sotto il livello del suolo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais 7","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Plac