 propose various walks and treasure hunts where historic city meets the city of the gastronomes, chocolate-lovers and beer-drinkers.\r\nOur tailor-made guided tours for groups are ideal to share with friends, colleagues or family members. Our little fairies will bend over backwards to create a tailor-made programme that will give your group a unique experience. We also offer a scheduled programme of activities that allow individual members of the public make the most of our passion for Brussels!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Once in Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"62","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@onceinbrussels.be","website":"http:\/\/www.onceinbrussels.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 850 60 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 62","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Once in Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"62","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@onceinbrussels.be","website":"http:\/\/www.onceinbrussels.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 850 60 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 62","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Once in Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"62","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@onceinbrussels.be","website":"http:\/\/www.onceinbrussels.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 850 60 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 62","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_orde